## The door

::music{playback="change" mood="triumph" volume="up"}
@narrator{code="0010"}: The Gatekeeper goes down the way a building does: slowly, and then all at once, and then for a long time afterward.
@narrator{code="0020"}: The maul skids across the landing. Its head has a smith's mark on the cheek — a small hammer inside a circle.
@wren{code="0010" mono}: Oskar's.
::assert{saw(sable, gatekeeperFall)}
@sable{code="0010" os}: ...Oh. Somebody finally knocked.
